      "policy_quote": "When changing class, the price difference is (new daily rate − old daily rate) × number of rental days. The number of rental days is shown in the booking. Quote the exact difference to the customer before asking for confirmation.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must calculate and state the exact price difference for the vehicle class upgrade, based on the difference in daily rates and the number of rental days, before seeking confirmation."
    },
    {
