      "policy_source_id": "q16",
      "policy_quote": "For `suv` and `premium` classes, every driver on the booking (primary and additional) must be at least 25 years old on the pickup date.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must ensure that all drivers (primary and additional) on the booking are at least 25 years old on the pickup date for the upgrade to `suv` or `premium` classes. If no additional drivers are present, only the primary driver's age must be verified."
